        "id": "1",
        "kind": "comment",
        "config": {
          "text": "A four-track loop through a three-band compressor. Press Space to play.\n\nThe Multiband Compressor splits the mix at 200 Hz and 2 kHz and compresses each band on its own, so the bass and kick can be held in check without the hi-hats ducking every time the kick hits. The meters under it show how hard each band is being turned down."
        },
        "ui": {
          "pos": [
            0.0,
            -232.0
