        "kind": "comment",
        "config": {
          "text": "Each band's gain_reduction (in dB, 0 or below) becomes a linear gain and drives a Meter, so a full bar means the band is untouched and a bar at −6 dB means it is being turned down 6 dB right now. Watch the low band dip on every kick while the high band barely moves."
