        "config": {
          "text": "Try this:\n• Click Bypass to compare with the uncompressed mix (Before and After show the levels).\n• Pull threshold_low down to −36 dB: the bass gets flatter and tighter while the cymbals stay lively.\n• Raise the ratio to 10 for a squashed, pumping sound, then lengthen release to smooth it.\n• Double-click the block to see the Band Split and the three Compressor blocks inside."
        },
